(7688340, 1259595, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the background- great contrast with the blot - and very well lit. Doesnt need much editing, which speaks to your skills. 8</td>', 'I really like the background- great contrast with the blot - and very well lit. Doesnt need much editing, which speaks to your skills. 8', '2021-03-01 08:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
