(7688342, 1259238, 66597, '<td valign="top">Love this. Well lit. Little editing needed. 8<br/>Looks so much like a cuddly teddy bear!</td>', 'Love this. Well lit. Little editing needed. 8Looks so much like a cuddly teddy bear!', '2021-03-01 08:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
