(7688609, 1259584, 141319, '<td valign="top">For me this is a teddy bear - I am sure some analyst would have a field day - but it is very cute and I love the texture you got. Also nicely photographed.</td>', 'For me this is a teddy bear - I am sure some analyst would have a field day - but it is very cute and I love the texture you got. Also nicely photographed.', '2021-03-03 15:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
