(7688898, 1259522, 4008, '<td valign="top">3rd place, thanks, did not expect that, considering the relative low score compared to winning images in other challenges.<br/> <br/>It was fun to do and actually not that much work compared to other studio type images (like <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1258979" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this one</a> ) that require build-up of backgrounds, setting up studio lights, endless fine tuning of the light, reflectors, position etc. and than selection and processing of the final image.</td>', '3rd place, thanks, did not expect that, considering the relative low score compared to winning images in other challenges. It was fun to do and actually not that much work compared to other studio type images (like this one ) that require build-up of backgrounds, setting up studio lights, endless fine tuning of the light, reflectors, position etc. and than selection and processing of the final image.', '2021-03-08 03:41:53.000000', NULL, 0),
